    {"id": "FIT-02", "priority": "explicit_missing_links", "finding": "The two descending sheaths start atZ−.318613m and end nearZ−.731/−.749m, whereas lever outlets are nearZ+.109m. They do not form a continuous cockpit-to-hub cable. Functions remain unknown.", "next_action": "Keep their visible free cut ends identifiable, and do not parent their entire paths to moving levers or hide the gap with a newly generated line."},
