    {"id": "FIT-04", "priority": "conditional_existing_position", "finding": "Clockcluster, ignition and visor have explicit shared working placements but no verified complete supporting structure. Currentvisor vs cluster sample test is clear; this does not validate the bracket or hidden fixings.", "next_action": "Review these sources at their stored coordinates; retain missing support/fixing interfaces in the caption."},
